        "en": "A working compiler that translates a subset of **Pascal into PL/1** — tokenizer, recursive-descent parser with an explicit precedence system, and a code generator emitting real PL/1 source. Built in Java as a clean multi-package pipeline, with the full end-to-end translation proven on a nested-`if` example program."
